# R71: a one-statement body on its header's line may not be followed by a
# second statement on that line. Before R71 the second statement silently ran
# outside the yadi - the line said one thing and the program did another.
mukhya()
    vitti c = 0
    yadi (1 == 2) c = c + 1; c = c + 10
    likha(c)
